UID:e5b3a73d73149bd90000a48bfbd7defc@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Job & Resource Fair will take place on Wednesday\, Oc
 tober 28\, 2026 from 11:00 – 2:00pm at the Sonoma County Fairgrounds in 
 Santa Rosa\, CA. The purpose of the Job & Resource Fair is to assist our u
 nsheltered and at risk population in finding employment and connecting wit
 h services which promote their well-being in order to do so. Applications 
 are currently being accepted for employers\, resource providers\, voluntee
 rs\, and sponsors interested in hosting a table or participating during th
 e event. The online application may be completed at the following link. ht
 tps://www.surveymonkey.com/r/F7BVC9X. For more information\, including the
  official event flyer\, participant details\, sponsorship levels or other 
 inquiries\, please contact Andrew.Akufo@sonomacounty.gov.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/2026-job-resource-fair
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
