DESCRIPTION:Sebastopol World Friends presents an authentic Ukrainian BBQ (
 shashlik) and specially brewed Ukrainian beers: “Ukrainian IPA” from C
 rooked Goat Brewing\, and “Zelensky’s Orange Juice” from John Kreidl
 er\, a special friend of SWF. There will be plentiful Ukrainian snacks\, B
 BQ\, vegetarian options\, beer\, wine\, and other beverages\, Ukrainian mu
 sic\, and lots of fun. Proceeds support Sebastopol World Friends on-going 
 efforts to fund renovation of a dormitory building in Chyhyryn\, Ukraine (
 Sebastopol’s sister city) that will house hundreds of Internally Displac
 ed People from areas of Ukraine who have been impacted by the war there. T
 ickets are $75 and are all inclusive. Register from this link https://www.
 tickettailor.com/events/sebastopolworldfriends/2286813
