BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Masters of Hawaiian Music: George Kahumoku Jr\, Led Kaapana\, Jeff
  Peterson
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T213000
UID:b1e6fe3b867af23583dd26ed8398f877@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience the soulful sounds and rich traditions of Hawai‘i
  with three legendary masters of slack key guitar—George Kahumoku Jr.\, 
 Led Kaapana\, and Jeff Peterson. Rooted in the 19th-century paniolo (Hawai
 ian cowboy) culture\, slack key is a uniquely Hawaiian open-tuning guitar 
 style passed down through generations. These three acclaimed musicians bri
 ng together decades of tradition\, storytelling\, and virtuosic musiciansh
 ip.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/masters-of-hawaiian-mus
 ic-george-kahumoku-jr-led-kaapana-jeff-peterson
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
